Z||000002||voyagerspe||05-13-2001||12:20 AM||||If the guy does good work 100 is a good price.  The tubing is cheap but if you found some one that will do it right Its worth the 100 just let him do it.(if you dont think you can do it yourself).  <P>||||reg||1
